<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="ed917880"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="2a78343">&lt;p&gt;
    Anticipate the types of defects anticipated in the test effort as processes and standards should be flexible enough to
    support different types of defects across projects.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="aefca2c1"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="23033d50"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="20f4afb5">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        The Testing Lead will work with the different teams to create a well defined set of standards and a process for
        managing defects.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        This process will define a systematic process all the way from discovery of a defect until its closure and how they
        will be reported to the larger group.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        The defect management process and standards will be reviewed and refined when a final approach is decided.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
